  "notes": "Test access (sandbox-like, test accounts only) is granted automatically/free upon enabling the API and OAuth2 client + developer token. Real production use requires applying for Basic access (auto-upgrade after brand verification) or Standard access, which needs a manual Google audit (~10 business days) — this gates broad/unlimited production use, hence admin_approval/app_review rather than pure self-serve. No official Google-published MCP server found; only third-party/community MCP servers exist (e.g. gomarble-ai, amekala). Auth requires both OAuth2 (user/service account) and a developer token (acts as an API-key-like credential) on every call.",
